	"Name": "Item Extensions",
	"Author": "mistyspring",
	"Description": "[size=3][i](If you're looking for a CON/CRC converter,\u00A0[b][u][url=https://mistyspring.neocities.org/converter]go here[/url][/u][/b])[/i][/size]\n<br />[b]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][img]https://mistyspring.neocities.org/Files/Titles/description.png[/img][/size][/b][size=3]\n<br />\n<br />Item Extensions is a framework. Like the name says, it expands on items' functionality.\n<br />[b]\n<br />[/b][color=#ffff00]\u00A0⚠[/color][color=#ffff00] This framework is[/color][b][color=#ffff00] ONLY [/color][/b][color=#ffff00]for[/color][b][color=#ffff00] 1.6[/color][/b]\n<br />\n<br />[/size]This framework lets you add:\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][size=3]Custom resources and clumps[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Customize drops (panning, train, treasure)[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]More than 1 trade requirement[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Custom eating animations[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Menu item interactions[/size]\n<br />[*]And more!\n<br />[/list][size=3]\n<br />There's also an [url=https://github.com/misty-spring/StardewMods/blob/main/ItemExtensions/Api.cs]API for C# mods.[/url][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b]The documentation is [url=https://github.com/misty-spring/StardewMods/blob/main/ItemExtensions/README.md]here[/url]. For templates, see the files tab.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]This mod has a lot of functions. If you're looking for examples, I'd suggest Lumisteria's\u00A0[/size][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9600]Visit Mt. Vapius[/url][size=3]\u00A0(which is a gorgeous expansion). Go check it out!\n<br />[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://mistyspring.neocities.org/Files/Titles/translations.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]French translation by Caranud\n<br />[*]Chinese translation by Awassakura\n<br />[*]Korean by yuuyeeyii\n<br />\n<br />[/list]\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://mistyspring.neocities.org/Files/Titles/contributions.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />The framework is open to PRs and collaborations (with prior discussion). Here's the modders who have contributed to the code:\u00A0\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Aceynk\n<br />[*]Itsbenter\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[url=https://ko-fi.com/mistyspring]\n<br />[/url][url=https://ko-fi.com/mistyspring][img]https://64.media.tumblr.com/1e06bee51b073224105aadd3b2df00bb/ce5c30fe86a2d83a-c5/s250x400/f2322c0d678a64c3d09bdf7cee5599b2003109ad.png[/img]\n<br />[/url]",
